        "updatedAt": "2026-06-17T22:36:54.774Z",
        "changeLog": "v2.3.0.1 #04 (17-06-2026):\n- Updated enhanced modsSettingsApi 1.3.0 (every mod now has its own reset button by its on/off switch that restores that mod's options and hotkeys to defaults; a search box reachable with Ctrl+F to quickly find a mod by name; and new options for mod authors)\n- Updated Tomato.gg (fixed playerpanels showing stats even when disabled)\n- Updated BalCalcMod 2.3.5, AutoAim Indication+ 2.0.5 and Show vehicle body in the sniper view 2.0.3 (small internal fix: they no longer re-save their config needlessly on every game start)\n- Updated Camo Selector 1.7 (added Style Share, custom styles now visible to other players using the mod, toggleable in the Customization menu)\n- Updated Pet Gift Auto Claim (static texts now follow the installed game language; some languages still unsupported)\n- Updated Research Progress Bar\n"
      },
      "current": {
        "modVersion": "05",
        "wotGameVersion": "2.3.0.1",
        "fileName": "Aslains_WoT_Modpack_Installer_v.2.3.0.1_05.exe",
        "updatedAt": "2026-06-19T17:44:06.434Z",
        "changeLog": "v2.3.0.1 #05 (19-06-2026):\n- Installer: Fixed searching a mod by number made its name invisible on light-themed Windows (now bold/underlined, like searching by name)\n- Updated enhanced modsSettingsApi 1.3.1 (overlapping fix; new option for mod authors)\n- Updated Minimap images: YaYa tactical (updated maps: Airfield, Lakeville and Safe Haven)\n- Updated Camo Selector 1.10 (fixed missing 2D styles + 3D attachments; added replay support for custom outfits; Disabled the purchase button when a not owned Element is applied)\n- Updated Danger Lights (removed old/new selections from the modpack; now only main entry, details set in‑garage mod menu)\n"
      }
